  "description": "<p>This Christian welcome mat offers an uplifting message and a faith-filled design, creating a warm and spiritually enriching entryway for your home. It features customization options for a unique personal touch. The doormat is designed for both indoor and outdoor use, providing a versatile home decor solution.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features uplifting Christian messages and faith-filled designs</li>\n<li>Customizable with personalized text</li>\n<li>Soft to the touch on bare feet</li>\n<li>Equipped with non-slip backing for stability</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor placement</li>\n<li>Helps dry wet feet and capture dirt, dust, and grime</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width=100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for placement in various locations, including bedrooms, bathrooms, living rooms, and especially at the front entry of your home to add a personal and blessed ambiance for guests.</p>",
